  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: httpclient5 5.6.2.rhlw-00005",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released org.apache.httpcomponents.client5:httpclient5 5.6.2.rhlw-00005 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-64607 and CVE-2026-71290.\n\nCVE-2026-64607: Apache HttpComponents Client: Connection Leak on Content-Encoding Decode Error Leads to Pool Exhaustion DoS\n\nCVE-2026-71290: Apache HttpComponents Client: TLS hostname verification silently disabled on the async transport (default config, MITM)\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for org.apache.httpcomponents.client5:httpclient5 5.6.2 from Maven Central.",
